10
00:03:10.486 --> 00:03:26.639
<v Amara>Now map that exact same gate principle onto seventy-six years of artificial intelligence from 1950 to 2026! Why did AI Winter One hit in 1974 and AI Winter Two hit in 1988?

11
00:03:26.909 --> 00:03:57.025
